OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FA breezy
OL,6,Fevening with showers slowly easing.
OL,7,FSome clear patches possible in the
OL,8,Fmiddle of the night with winds falling
OL,9,Flight, then becoming steadily more
OL,10,Funsettled during the early hours as
OL,11,Frain and strong gusts arrive from the
OL,12,Fsouthwest.
OL,13,
OL,14,CMonday:FStrengthening winds under a
OL,15,Fband of persistent rain to start.
OL,16,FPatchy rain and some brighter spells
OL,17,Fby afternoon, but winds continue to
OL,18,Fstrengthen with coastal gales possible
OL,19,Flater.
